{"caption":"The video captures a dancer in a studio with a mirrored wall, a ballet barre, and string lights. She faces the mirror, wearing a gray acid-washed denim vest, black top, black pants, and white sneakers. Her pink face mask is visible in the reflection. She holds both hands raised to her face, forming a shape in front of her forehead with her feet planted wide apart.

As the clip progresses, she begins to move. One arm extends outward to the side with motion blur while the other hand remains near her forehead. Her torso then rotates to one side, and the previously raised arm sweeps down and across her body, causing her long hair to swing and the vest's hanging fabric to shift.

In the final frames, both arms come down to her sides with open hands near her hips. The body settles into a slightly angled stance and continues a small torso lean and sway to the end of the clip. The reflection reproduces all of these motions in mirror-reversed form throughout.", "length_note":""}
